description:
Create a Provider trait that abstracts LLM communication.

## Implementation
```rust
#[async_trait]
pub trait Provider: Send + Sync {
    fn name(&self) -> &str;
    async fn generate(&self, messages: &[Message], tools: Option<&[Tool]>) -> Result<Response>;
    async fn generate_stream(&self, messages: &[Message]) -> Result<impl Stream<Item = Chunk>>;
    fn supports_tools(&self) -> bool;
    fn max_context_tokens(&self) -> usize;
}
```

## Acceptance
- Trait defined in src/providers/mod.rs
- Common message/response types
- Error handling for provider-specific errors
